      "durationSeconds": 35,
      "vo": "One. Block rm dash r f before it ever runs. Two. Run your tests after every single edit. Three. Auto format the moment it saves a file. Four. Warn yourself before it touches dot e n v. Five. Log every command it runs, so you can see what it actually did.",
      "notes": "NO CUTS IN THIS SCENE — that is the whole point of the format. One take underneath, the checklist fills item by item on top, captions match the spoken words.\n\nThe five checklist delays and the five caption delays are the same numbers on purpose; retime them together or the caption stops matching the row it belongs to.\n\nNO LIVE TIMER: `stat-counter` is a count-up animation with a hardcoded 50-frame window, not a clock — it reaches 0 in under two seconds and then sits there. The banner's 'in 35 seconds' carries the completion promise instead. A real timer needs an optional duration prop on StatCounter; ask before adding it.",
